menu "Bead designer"

config BEAD_SERIAL_KEYS
    bool "Keyboard control over the UART0 console (bench testing)"
    default y
    help
        Read single keys from the serial console (idf.py monitor) and inject them
        as input events, so the full UI can be driven without encoders or buttons.
        Keys: a/d = left knob CCW/CW, w/s = right knob CCW/CW, space or p = place
        (right push), x = erase (left push), m = MENU (colour picker), o = SIDE/settings,
        t = colour test bars, ? = print key help.
        Disable for production builds.

config BEAD_PERF_LOG
    bool "Log redraw and autosave timing per input event"
    default n
    help
        Bench diagnostics: logs how long each redraw and autosave takes (in us),
        and every full-screen redraw. Off by default.

config BEAD_EXPORT_URL
    string "Base URL of the export page (QR export)"
    default "https://teddygavi.github.io/pixel-painter-export/"
    help
        The Export screen shows a QR code for <this URL>#<pattern>. The page is the
        static web/index.html; the pattern itself travels in the URL fragment, so
        the device needs no network and the phone only fetches the static page.

endmenu
